Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning bright for what's ahead, you\Nsee, is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way, the best that we\Nknow. With tears and doubts and tone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.90,0:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll go where we all wanna go The\Npage within brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I blocked that, but\Nhis thunder Bagua was too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamabro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you help that\Noversized coward over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just call me a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn right I did! Now shut up! Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! Be patient! I'm not a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it must be done!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't summon my\Ncourage in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.98,0:02:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to\Nworry, I'll back you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do this together
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:03:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I left before that\Nwon't happen again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's stop Onigashima
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamato, Momonosuke
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.74,0:03:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here, or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, give me strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I must...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I must!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, he's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight him alone, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can grab the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons can create clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never done such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a great and powerful dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying is like second nature to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have complete faith in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the power to create clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Ward, Momonosuke,\Nand run away! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons don't fly like a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They create clouds and grab onto them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They run through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of power you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A fire in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We call them fling clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop here for a second. See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Kaido planned for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk Hazard is falling apart. So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad sign, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like his power\Nmight be weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame clouds he created are unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't support the\Ncracked bedrock anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we must make haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lay my body to waste if\Nthat's what it takes to triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I must protect my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As the future Shogun, that\Nis the very least I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I grew up to stop this island,\Nand that's what I'm going to do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course, but that won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just shove it away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we've nearly reached\Nthe capital already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We have mere moments to spare
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop it with your flame clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what's making it\Nfloat in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido is controlling\NOnigashima with his clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to push back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You must create more\Npowerful ones than his.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I barely even know how to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, we cannot be certain that\NI have the same abilities as Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've already made flame clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is coming to help us, and the\Nsituation is more serious than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,if kaido's plan succeeds\Nthere will be countless
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,fatalities in the capital but that's not
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the worst case scenario\Nanymore if kaido runs
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,out of strength his flame\Nclouds will disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,then onigashima will go\Nhurtling to the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,at full speed causing\Nunimaginable destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But its size isn't the\Nonly problem. Onigashima
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,is full of gunpowder and explosives too
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be like dropping a bomb\Nthe size of a mountain on the city
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's too late to warn them we're far
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,too close they wouldn't\Nhave time to evacuate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,our allies would all die\Nand the capital would
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,burn to ashes let's go\Nback we have to stop luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is the only one\Ncapable of defeating Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is his only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of Wano is on\Nhis shoulders alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything to\Njeopardize his victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll finish this ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone, without anyone else knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.46,0:09:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the biggest piss off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,King the Wildfire happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have figured, but those lead\Nperformer guys are nothing to scoff at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're down to the top guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me to back you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck! Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you aim in that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You just cut my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame I didn't cut your neck instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.18,0:10:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro just made a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows you don't lay a\Nfinger on Master King's mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be lucky if we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.44,0:11:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if anyone's ever\Nseen his face under that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.42,0:11:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,IMPERIAL ULTRA!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,ULTRA TIGER!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.44,0:11:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,RAFT!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.44,0:12:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword style. Clear land.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you for trying\Nto kill me without your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you doubting what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It does sound absurd, I admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In terms of the dragon's\Norigin, I do have a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,though I can't guess their identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be a man-made Devil Fruit, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be with\NStraw Hat Luffy's ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the pirates destroy each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why did you really call us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I received some new orders from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A contingency plan, in case Kaido loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano, currently\Nunaffiliated with the world government,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,is to be placed under our direct control,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.68,0:13:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,effective immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They've already sent a small fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They will be ready soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Seizing a country by force, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasty business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hardly better than pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are the odds that Kaido doesn't win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When this began, Kaido had\N30,000 troops on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's down to roughly 12,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai started with 5,400\Ntroops, but now are 8,000 strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit it's been fascinating\Nto watch this battle unfold,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but as for Kaido facing\Ndefeat, I can't imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep me updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:14:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I received one more order. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must bring in Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who wins tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Both pirate crews need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the key to everything for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already blown this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't screw it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Delict.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not laying a single\Nfinger on my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-verse humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrow notch. Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.62,0:14:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, how did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was aiming for stylish\Nbut simple this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, you're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nico Robin, straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:14:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Surround her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let her escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a nice crowd, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare say you're turning\Ninto quite the superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fame is such a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Any good advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly have experience\Nwith an overbearing fan base.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.42,0:15:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What a star needs is a good bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got the best, my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me blush and\NI don't even have skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth and be powerful, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all collapsing so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Momonosuke. New plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But in case the island does fall, I\Nneed to try to minimize the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.58,0:16:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to the Skull Dome now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Down in the armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There are thousands of explosives\Njust waiting to go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to take care of them somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it doesn't come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least I can stop the capital\Nfrom being completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I need guidance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make stronger flame\Nclouds than Kaido's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Curses! Curses! Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame clouds! Come forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you leave me all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't help. You can do it, you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,this is fruitless no stop\Nstop don't say that you just
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,need more practice that's\Nall flame clouds Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The lives of my people are at stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not fall on my capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You wicked, wicked bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a big wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have faith in you, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame clouds, come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good dance partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you some moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying pound!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like a funk machine gun, and\Nyou can't stop the beat, you dig it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.12,0:19:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you've got no rhythm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to show me the good stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see German Double\NSix's combat suit now! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought out your suit\Nwhen you were fighting King.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he special?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It made you darn invisible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Judge's handiwork\Nif I've ever seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You really know how to push my buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm feeling weird again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wear the suit, you tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Vinsmoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How thick is your head, you stupid lizard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know my family situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even think of them as family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not wearing that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:19:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get ready, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.88,0:20:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Coffee Bean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Diable Jabra.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Carol shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.16,0:21:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That kick didn't hurt at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna take something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This lizard isn't going down easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty good kick for a\Nmeat bag. Just to be sporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the power of a\Ndinosaur, raw as nature intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to experience 100 million\Nyears of evolutionary perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow down, puty humans. It's\Ntime for a history lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.12,0:21:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.03,0:21:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Because here comes prehistoric power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying, begging, cowering in fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Brachiosnakeia!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I caught you\Noff guard. This is what a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,brachiosaurus is capable\Nof I had no idea Damn it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your squishy human body\Nis no match For the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,raw ancient power\Ncoursing through my veins
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.80,0:23:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever escaped from\Nmy brachio-coilus technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll squeeze the life out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.44,0:23:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sangoro, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.76,0:23:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.90,0:23:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That dinosaur man is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.82,0:23:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll crush him! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.82,0:23:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The strength of dinosaurs\Ndefies all reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fy, Fungaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.76,0:23:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a master of conquerors\NHaki could escape this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The pressure will shadow your bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,crush your internal organs, and compress\Nyour body into a human meatball.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.82,0:23:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you're judges, boy,\NI'll cut you a sweet deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.96,0:23:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me Jerma's power\Nsuit and I'll let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat's getting squeezed to paste, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.10,0:24:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.80,0:24:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You see my torso and legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.52,0:24:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They would be totally useless right\Nnow if I was a normal Brachiosaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm better than normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.50,0:24:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.60,0:24:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I equipped my useless torso\Nwith powerful weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.78,0:24:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My genius sees a problem in\Nnature and improves upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.80,0:24:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Their voice activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.64,0:24:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is call their\Nname and they'll fire on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.84,0:24:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called Brachio Launchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.10,0:24:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They fire, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.80,0:24:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just saying the\Nname conversationally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.58,0:24:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid torso!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.08,0:24:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only supposed to fire when\NI get it like a cool technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.68,0:24:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,BRACIOLAUNCHERS!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.68,0:24:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Queen, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.38,0:24:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I know the\Nblasters are effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.60,0:25:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, my constriction\Ntechnique did the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.02,0:25:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The fight's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.78,0:25:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came to bury you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.28,0:25:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how many broken\Nbones he has after all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.20,0:25:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's worse, his organs\Nare probably a mess as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.64,0:25:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Our choice is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.38,0:25:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We must use the mink medicine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.18,0:25:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crooked. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.92,0:25:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.92,0:25:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it hurts, but it seems\Nlike I can walk at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.02,0:25:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaky, you didn't turn\Ninto a zombie, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.46,0:25:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.54,0:25:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.50,0:26:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to me,\Nit's really freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.00,0:26:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.08,0:26:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something trigger it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.92,0:26:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I going to end up like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.38,0:26:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.29,0:26:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay focused!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.68,0:26:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.32,0:26:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time I got\Nhit was just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.40,0:26:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish you this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.96,0:26:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.60,0:26:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.60,0:26:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.92,0:26:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to become\Na monster like them!
